0..73 Comment "/// This source compares two transports when one value comes from a call."
74..77 Comment "///"
78..148 Comment "/// The lowering binds the call result before it transports the value."
149..208 Comment "/// The kernel evaluates the call before it reads the path."
209..212 Comment "///"
213..275 Comment "/// Each row uses the same variable path and one value family."
276..342 Comment "/// The loop family and the fixed-point family give the two cases."
